    "created_at": "2015-12-01T09:54:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-01T09:54:16Z",
    "body": "The constructor per definition creates the object, yet its mentioned that a new EventSource object should be created as if explicitly inside the constructor at the third list entry.\n\nThe object is called by calling the constructor, yet its mentioned like something to do inside the constructor?\n",
