    "created_at": "2015-12-01T10:46:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-01T10:46:26Z",
    "body": "That's a definition that may work in some programming languages, but not here. A \"constructor\" in this context is simply an algorithm that is called from https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-interface-call (\"Let _R_ be the result of performing the actions listed in the description of _constructor_ with _values_ as the argument values.\") It does not implicitly create an object.\n",
